- * ST VD55G0 firmware patch and mode configuration, transplanted verbatim
- * from the Surface Pro 11 Windows camx sensormodule configuration
- * (com.surface.sensormodule.aux_vd55g0_MSHW0492.bin).
+ * ST VD55G0 firmware patch and mode configuration.
+ *
+ * The patch was transplanted verbatim from the Surface Pro 11 Windows camx
+ * sensormodule configuration (com.surface.sensormodule.aux_vd55g0_MSHW0492.bin);
+ * the Surface Pro 12 (Intel) Windows driver (vd55g0.sys) carries the same
+ * 552 bytes. The mode configuration is the Surface Pro 12 driver's 19.2 MHz
+ * table: unlike the Surface Pro 11 one it sets GPIO0/GPIO1 (0x0469/0x046a) to
+ * strobe, which drives the IR illuminator, and uses 644 lines of exposure at
+ * 4x analogue gain as its starting point.
  *
  * Patch: 552 bytes uploaded at 0x2000 while in READY_TO_BOOT, applied
  * with BOOT=2 (load patch) then BOOT=1 (boot), both self-clearing.
